<title>HONG KONG: Shandong Xinhua posts 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Shandong Xinhua posts 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)	     0.361</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	0.011</p>
<p>    Exceptional items    nil</p>
<p>    Net			96.78</p>
<p>    Turnover		 842.20</p>
<p>    Company name	   Shandong Xinhua Pharmaceutical Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	    May 17 to June 16</p>
<p>    Dividend payable     June 23</p>
<p>NOTE - Medicine maker Shandong Xinhua engages in the development, manufacture and sales of bulk pharmaceuticals, preparations and chemical products. It was listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
